msgstr "Puedes obtener los registros de cambios completos de  link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.1.0.CR1[2]  link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.1.0.Final[.]  link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.1.0.CR1[1.0.CR1] y  link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.1.0.Final[2.1.0.Final] en GitHub."

